<title>NETHERLANDS: V/D MOOLEN PLANS TO ACQUIRE JONKER &amp; CO.</title>
<headline>V/D MOOLEN PLANS TO ACQUIRE JONKER &amp; CO.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Van der Moolen said it planned to acquire Jonker &amp; Co, a broker in privately placed loans (onderhandse leningen), from Westland/Utrecht Hypotheekbank.  </p>
<p>Van der Moolen said that if the deal went through as eexpected, it would merge Jonker &amp; Co with its money market and foreign exchange broking unit Wallich &amp; Mathes.</p>
<p>Van der Moolen -- an Amsterdam based market maker and interdealer securities broker -- said the planned acquisition formed part of its strategy of achieving a wider spread of revenue sources.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
